    "windowsDeepProbe": "Own-process COM observer compiles the unchanged production Windows desktop implementation at this release source and connects to the real release executable running its HTTP host. It exercises WebView2 authentication/SSE, input, retained UI, CF_HDROP and IFileOpenDialog. It is not an Explorer mouse gesture or instrumentation inside the shipped executable.",
